pageType: content
background: { type: solid, color: "$bg" }
elements:
  - elementId: header-marker
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [36, 24, 8, 30]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }
  - elementId: header-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [54, 22, 680, 34]
    content: { style: "$pageTitle", wrap: false, text: "03. 预测模型 —— LSTM 结构与输入" }
  - elementId: header-brand
    elementType: text
    bounds: [730, 30, 194, 14]
    content: { style: "$label", fontSize: 9, align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: EV RANGE · RESEARCH }
  - elementId: header-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [36, 66, 888, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primaryDeep" }
  - elementId: statement
    elementType: text
    bounds: [52, 78, 856, 42]
    content:
      style: "$statement"
      align: [center, middle]
      text: |-
        <p>三门结构把 SOC、Q 与工况映射为<span style="color:$danger">逐时刻里程</span></p>
  - elementId: fig-frame
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [36, 132, 888, 164]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: fig-13
    elementType: image
    bounds: [40, 136, 880, 156]
    src: media/fig13_lstm.jpg
    fit: { mode: contain }
  - elementId: fig-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [36, 302, 888, 28]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 9
      align: [center, top]
      text: |-
        <p><span style="color:$primary"><strong>图 13</strong></span>　LSTM 内部节点结构：遗忘门、输入门、输出门与细胞状态的时序传递；来源：陈默等（2024）</p>
  - elementId: input-frame
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [36, 342, 430, 92]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primarySoft" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$primaryTint" }
  - elementId: input-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [54, 350, 394, 18]
    content: { style: "$heading", fontSize: 12, wrap: false, text: t 时刻模型输入 }
  - elementId: input-formula
    elementType: text
    bounds: [54, 370, 394, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$text"
      text: |-
        <p>\(x_t = \{\mathrm{SOC},\ Q,\ T_e,\ P_l,\ C\}\)</p>
  - elementId: input-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [54, 400, 394, 28]
    content: { style: "$caption", fontSize: 9, text: 依次为电池荷电状态、驾驶行为量化因子、环境温度、电器负荷率与速度工况。 }
  - elementId: gates-frame
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [482, 342, 442, 92]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: gates-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [500, 350, 406, 18]
    content: { style: "$heading", fontSize: 12, wrap: false, text: 门控与状态更新 }
  - elementId: gates-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [500, 372, 406, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 10.5
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |-
        <p>遗忘门　\(f_t = \sigma\left(W_f [h_{t-1}, x_t] + b_f\right)\)</p>
        <p>细胞态　\(C_t = f_t C_{t-1} + i_t g_t\)</p>
        <p>输出门　\(h_t = o_t \otimes \tanh(C_t)\)</p>
  - elementId: takeaway-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [36, 452, 888, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }
  - elementId: wave-left
    elementType: line
    bounds: [50, 464, 48, 14]
    viewBox: [48, 14]
    points: "0,7 8,7 12,2 17,12 23,5 28,7 48,7"
    curve: sharp
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$accent4" }
  - elementId: wave-right
    elementType: line
    bounds: [862, 464, 48, 14]
    viewBox: [48, 14]
    points: "0,7 20,7 25,5 31,12 36,2 40,7 48,7"
    curve: sharp
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$accent4" }
  - elementId: takeaway
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 456, 760, 30]
    content: { style: "$takeaway", align: [center, middle], wrap: false, text: 遗忘门筛选历史，输入门写入当前，输出门给出预测 }
  - elementId: footer-source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [36, 510, 680, 12]
    content: { style: "$nav", fontSize: 8.2, wrap: false, text: 来源：陈默等（2024），图 13 与 LSTM 模型定义 }
  - elementId: footer-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [836, 510, 88, 12]
    content: { style: "$nav", color: "$primary", bold: true, align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: 09 / 15 }
